  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> be a square matrix of order <math><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;be the transpose matrix of matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>.&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math> is equal to <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "96",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>96</mn></math></p>"
